     "updated": "2011-05-23T12:57:58.966-0300"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Further observations",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "String datetime is set to current date (new Date()) as a static at class level",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "test object demo:REST has CREATED set for datastreams RELS-EXT and RELS-INT, but ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " for DC to this value",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Ingest will take place (theoretically?) ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "after",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " datetime - so DC will have a created date later than datetime (as will the object creation date/time)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "So the validate is failing correctly - it is validating the object at an earlier datetime than the created date for DC - so DC won't have any versions present.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The behaviour now seems correct to me - but I have no idea why this should have not been failing on other databases - perhaps with Derby the whole thing is running faster and the ingest date/time is in fact (to the date/time precision) the same as datetime set at class level?  I would have expected the odd spurious test failure from time-to-time.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
